-search fs-2" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="sr-only">Search</span></button></div></form><div class="linksBelowSearch"><a href="/home/online-services">Online Services</a> | <a href="/government/departments-and-agencies">Government Directory</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="indexContent"><main><section id="home"><div class="container"><div id="bgCredit" role="complementary" aria-label="Background Credit and Location"><span>Background Credit: Hawai'i Tourism Authority (HTA) / Tor Johnson</span></div><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-md-6 order-2 order-md-1"><div class="card" id="home-latestNews" role="region" aria-label="Latest News"><div class="card-body"><h3>Latest News</h3></div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush newsItems"><li class="list-group-item newsItem"><h4><a href="https://www.librarieshawaii.org/2026/07/31/aloha-festivals/" class="newsTitle" data-title="Aloha Festivals Celebrates 80 Years of Hawaiian Culture and Community">Aloha Festivals Celebrates 80 Years of Hawaiian Culture and Community</a></h4><small class="newsInfo text-muted">Friday, July 31, 2026 04:27 PM from Hawaiʻi State Public Library System</small></li><li class="list-group-item newsItem"><h4><a href="https://dlnr.hawaii.gov/blog/2026/07/31/nr26-92/" class="newsTitle" data-title="7/31/26 – 2026 PU‘U WA‘AWA‘A FOREST RESERVE AND PU‘U ANAHULU GAME MANAGEMENT AREA HUNTING SEASONS APPROACHING">7/31/26 – 2026 PU‘U WA‘AWA‘A FOREST RESERVE AND PU‘U ANAHULU GAME MANAGEMENT AREA HUNTING SEASONS APPROACHING</a></h4><small class="newsInfo text-muted">Friday, July 31, 2026 01:01 PM from Department of Land and Natural Resources</small></li><li class="list-group-item newsItem"><h4><a href="https://governor.hawaii.gov/newsroom/office-of-the-governor-news-release-gov-green-announces-boards-and-commissions-appointments/" class="newsTitle" data-title="Office of the Governor — News Release — Gov. Green Announces Boards and Commissions Appointments">Office of the Governor — News Release — Gov. Green Announces Boards and Commissions Appointments</a></h4><small class="newsInfo text-muted">Friday, July 31, 2026 12:16 PM from Office of the Governor</small></li><li class="list-group-item newsItem"><h4><a href="https://humanservices.hawaii.gov/hawai%ca%bbi-state-commission-judiciary-and-coalition-announce-launch-of-hawai%ca%bbi-safety-survey-questionnaire-is-part-of-a-working-group-study-to-address-domestic-violence-and-improve-survivor-s/" class="newsTitle" data-title="Hawaiʻi State Commission, Judiciary and Coalition Announce Launch of Hawaiʻi Safety Survey: Questionnaire is Part of a Working Group Study to Address Domestic Violence and Improve Survivor Safety">Hawaiʻi State Commission, Judiciary and Coalition Announce Launch of Hawaiʻi Safety Survey: Questionnaire is Part of a Working Group Study to Address Domestic Violence and Improve Survivor Safety</a></h4><small class="newsInfo text-muted">Friday, July 31, 2026 11:31 AM from Department of Human Services</small></li><li class="list-group-item newsItem"><h4><a href="https://governor.hawaii.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2607088_Ninth-Proclamation-Relating-to-March-and-April-2026-Weather-Events.pdf#new_tab" class="newsTitle" data-title="Ninth Proclamation Relating to March and April 2026 Weather Events">Ninth Proclamation Relating to March and April 2026 Weather Events</a></h4><small class="newsInfo text-muted">Friday, July 31, 2026 11:03 AM from Office of the Governor</small></li><li class="list-group-item"><a href="/home/latest-news" class="more">More News Articles</a></li></ul></div><div id="homeLinks" role="region" aria-label="Quick Links"><div class="row no-gutters"><div class="col-6 col-xl-4"><a href="/government/departments-and-agencies" class="homeLink hoverEffect"><span class="fad fa-landmark" role="img" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span>Agencies</span></a></div><div class="col-6 col-xl-4"><a href="//calendar.ehawaii.gov/calendar/" class="homeLink hoverEffect"><span class="fad fa-calendar-alt